From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rations <ehqcar@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:45:00 +0000
Subject: drm/vc4: plane: Don't take an async update of an offscreen plane

Pivuan: on a Pi 5 at 3840x2160, SonicDE's display settings (KScreen) set
1920x1080 and shrink the X screen afterwards. In between, the mouse
pointer is outside the CRTC, so the cursor plane is offscreen in both the
old and the new state. vc6_plane_mode_set() leaves such a plane with no
dlist (dlist_count 0), and vc4_plane_duplicate_state() turns the dlist into
ZERO_SIZE_PTR (a 0-byte kmemdup). vc4_plane_atomic_async_check() only
compares the dlist sizes (0 == 0), so the next cursor move takes
vc4_plane_atomic_async_update(), which reads dlist[pos0_offset] through
ZERO_SIZE_PTR:

  Unable to handle kernel NULL pointer dereference at virtual address 0000000000000014
  pc : vc4_plane_atomic_async_update+0x1d0/0x2b0 [vc4]
   drm_atomic_helper_async_commit+0x70/0x160 [drm_kms_helper]
   ...
   drm_mode_cursor2_ioctl+0x18/0x30 [drm]

and Xorg is left half dead. Refuse the async path when either state has
no dlist, so the update goes through a normal (sync) commit, which handles
an offscreen plane. Also missing in mainline and rpi-7.2.y.
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/vc4/vc4_plane.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/vc4/vc4_plane.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/vc4/vc4_plane.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/vc4/vc4_plane.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/vc4/vc4_plane.c
@@ -2626,6 +2626,13 @@
 	if (!new_vc4_state->hw_dlist)
 		return -EINVAL;
 
+	/* An offscreen plane has no dlist (dlist_count 0, and dlist the
+	 * ZERO_SIZE_PTR of a 0-byte kmemdup), so there are no pos0, pos2
+	 * and ptr0 words to update: take a sync update instead.
+	 */
+	if (!old_vc4_state->dlist_count || !new_vc4_state->dlist_count)
+		return -EINVAL;
+
 	if (old_vc4_state->dlist_count != new_vc4_state->dlist_count ||
 	    old_vc4_state->pos0_offset != new_vc4_state->pos0_offset ||
 	    old_vc4_state->pos2_offset != new_vc4_state->pos2_offset ||
-- 
